          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uyu munsi nawe, iyo umenya ibyaguhesha amahoro! Ariko noneho bihishwe amaso yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko iminsi izaza, ubwo abanzi bawe bazakubakaho uruzitiro. Bazakugota, bazakurinda cyane impande zose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bazagutsembana n'abana bawe batuye muri wowe. Ntibazagusigira ibuye rigeretse ku rindi, kuko utamenye igihe wagenderewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
